{
  // Agentic OS — OpenCode Configuration
  // Portable: works on any machine with hermes on $PATH
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
  "plugin": [
    "oh-my-openagent@latest",
    // graphify plugin — auto-generated by `graphify install --platform opencode`
    // Install with: uv tool install graphifyy && graphify install --platform opencode
    // This registers a tool.execute.before hook that reminds you about the knowledge graph.
    "GRAPHIFY_PLUGIN_PATH_PLACEHOLDER"
  ],
  "lsp": true,
  "rules": [
    "## Agentic OS — Memory Usage (MANDATORY)",
    "This project uses agentmemory MCP for persistent memory across sessions.",
    "agentmemory tools: memory_save, memory_recall, memory_smart_search, memory_sessions, memory_export",
    "",
    "BEFORE starting any task:",
    "  - Call memory_smart_search(query=\"context for your task\") to find past decisions and relevant context.",
    "  - Read any relevant results — never redo or revert past work.",
    "",
    "AFTER completing any task:",
    "  - Save a task summary via memory_save(content=\"<markdown summary>\", category=\"agentic-os\").",
    "  - Include: what was done, key files changed, decisions made, why.",
    "",
    "Your memory persists between OpenCode sessions. Use it.",
    "",
    "## Agentic OS — Skill Auto-Run (MANDATORY)",
    "Auto-run these skills based on task type. Available skills are loaded — use the skill tool to invoke them.",
    "",
    "WHEN asked to implement a new feature, add a significant change, or the task is complex:",
    "  - Run /grill-with-docs to stress-test the plan against the domain model.",
    "  - Update CONTEXT.md as terminology is clarified during the session.",
    "  - Document hard-to-reverse decisions as ADRs using ADR-FORMAT.md.",
    "  - Skip this for trivial changes (typos, renaming, simple fixes).",
    "",
    "WHEN asked to debug an error, fix a bug, or investigate unexpected behavior:",
    "  - Run /diagnose to apply structured debugging workflow first.",
    "  - Identify root cause before proposing or writing fixes.",
    "",
    "WHEN asked to improve codebase architecture or structure:",
    "  - Run /zoom-out to get a high-level overview of the relevant area first.",
    "  - Then run /improve-codebase-architecture for structured improvement.",
    "",
    "WHEN asked to design or implement UI:",
    "  - If a target URL is available, run: designlang <url> --json-pretty",
    "  - Review extracted design tokens (colors, typography, spacing) before implementing.",
    "",
    "WHEN asked to write tests or ensure correctness:",
    "  - Run /tdd to apply test-driven development workflow.",
    "",
    "WHEN asked to convert plans to structured output:",
    "  - For product requirements: run /to-prd",
    "  - For GitHub issues: run /to-issues",
    "",
    "These auto-runs happen before any code is written. Let the skill guide the process."
  ],
  "mcp": {
    "hermes": {
      "type": "local",
      "command": ["hermes", "mcp", "serve"],
      "enabled": true
    },
    "playwright": {
      "type": "local",
      "command": ["playwright-mcp"],
      "args": ["--headless", "--no-sandbox"],
      "enabled": true
    },
    "composio": {
      "type": "remote",
      "url": "https://connect.composio.dev/mcp",
      "headers": {
        "x-consumer-api-key": "{env:COMPOSIO_API_KEY}"
      },
      "enabled": true
    },
    "agentmemory": {
      "type": "local",
      "command": ["npx", "-y", "@agentmemory/mcp"],
      "enabled": true
    },
    "designlang": {
      "type": "local",
      "command": ["designlang", "mcp"],
      // DESIGNLANG_OUTPUT_DIR is replaced by install.sh with $HOME/design-extract-output
      "args": ["--output-dir", "DESIGNLANG_OUTPUT_DIR_PLACEHOLDER"],
      "enabled": true
    }
  }
}
